hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1090","Yunus bin Abdul-Ala told us, Ibn Wahb told us, H. And Ibn Abdul-Hakam told me that Ibn Wahb told them, he told me Yunus, on the authority of Ibn Shihab, on the authority of Salim bin Abdullah bin Omar, on the authority of his father, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, used to glorify Ali He goes to the departing woman before any destination, and performs the Witr prayer over her, but he does not perform the prescribed prayer over her.”"
